This product includes software developed by third parties.

- KeyboardShortcuts (https://github.com/sindresorhus/KeyboardShortcuts)
- FluidAudio (https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio)
- Sparkle (https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle)

Flowstay for Windows is a port of Flowstay (https://github.com/maketheproduct/flowstay).
It additionally uses:
- Transformers.js / ONNX Runtime Web (Apache-2.0)
- Tauri (Apache-2.0 / MIT)
- Preact (MIT)
- transcribe.cpp / ggml (MIT) speech engine
- Models: NVIDIA Parakeet (CC-BY-4.0, GGUF conversions by Handy), Qwen3.5 (Apache-2.0)
- Design ideas from Handy (MIT, github.com/cjpais/Handy) and Murmur (github.com/per-simmons/murmur-youtube)
